to":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236677.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jules118","Id":236677,"Name":"jules118","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cdc41d5882792a955b601df198068d02","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks everyone - my guests should start receiving these today - can&#039;t wait to hear the responses!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1408975,"PostDate":1299076286,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks everyone - my guests should start receiving these today - can't wait to hear the responses!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Steph & John........Atlantis.......June 18, 2011......happily married<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"steph@tmgatl.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283285042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231931.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skp1","Id":231931,"Name":"skp1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ff8bf3b5fcc9319ee010316e766f1bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; They look amazing! &amp;nbsp;How much do you think it cost you to make each invitation? &amp;nbsp;Where did you get the palm tree stamp for your wax seal?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1411694,"PostDate":1299463557,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> They look amazing! \u00a0How much do you think it cost you to make each invitation? \u00a0Where did you get the palm tree stamp for your wax seal?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christinakosar@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297910195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236882.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ckntb","Id":236882,"Name":"ckntb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1067f11d36620c58e26b4e30ac7eb55","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It cost about $200 to make 50 invitations and literally half of that was the printing on the blue paper - so I can&#039;t stress enough - don&#039;t use dark paper.&amp;nbsp; i had too much vested at that point to change it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got the palm tree stamp and wax from Sam Flax which is a large art supply store - I think they have locations nationwide.&amp;nbsp; It was in their paper\/invitation department.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve also seen some on line with just Yahoo searches - don&#039;t know exact names but had contemplated ordering it first.&amp;nbsp; Michael&#039;s only had the standard heart or wedding themed ones.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1411869,"PostDate":1299508785,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It cost about $200 to make 50 invitations and literally half of that was the printing on the blue paper - so I can't stress enough - don't use dark paper.\u00a0 i had too much vested at that point to change it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got the palm tree stamp and wax from Sam Flax which is a large art supply store - I think they have locations nationwide.\u00a0 It was in their paper\/invitation department.\u00a0 I've also seen some on line with just Yahoo searches - don't know exact names but had contemplated ordering it first.\u00a0 Michael's only had the standard heart or wedding themed ones.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Steph & John........Atlantis.......June 18, 2011......happily married<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"steph@tmgatl.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283285042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231931.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skp1","Id":231931,"Name":"skp1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08150128779673c009b9a033d35c6d06","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These turned out fantastic!!!&amp;nbsp; GREAT JOB!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1411934,"PostDate":1299514377,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These turned out fantastic!!!\u00a0 GREAT JOB!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Beaches Turks & Caicos - October 21, 2011<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"michelle0200@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274547514,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228450.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Michelle-2","Id":228450,"Name":"Michelle-2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac79240a10533d468be59d1c2c0fb13a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are great!!&amp;nbsp; They looks so professional and all your little touches really add to it.&amp;nbsp; Thanks so much for sharing.&amp;nbsp; My passports are about done but you have made me think of some things that I might want to change.&amp;nbsp; Thanks again!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1411945,"PostDate":1299515003,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are great!!\u00a0 They looks so professional and all your little touches really add to it.\u00a0 Thanks so much for sharing.\u00a0 My passports are about done but you have made me think of some things that I might want to change.\u00a0 Thanks again!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sxctaz18@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1279753450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230504.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":123,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sxcT","Id":230504,"Name":"sxcT","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e7394557c29feb32f3dc02c62a3169d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; By far the best DIY passports I&#039;ve seen show up on here. Bravo!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1413259,"PostDate":1299639694,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> By far the best DIY passports I've seen show up on here. Bravo!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aqharider@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.20.179.61","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154388180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/9\/9f\/9fd8e240_user-274-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sarah","Id":206770,"Name":"Sarah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"610a181849d06338f0e5e1e9835634e1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; SUCH a great job!&amp;nbsp; And thanks for the details on materials especially!&amp;nbsp; I have been trying to figure out what thickness of paper to use and you wouldn&#039;t believe how hard it is to find that info!&amp;nbsp; They look so awesome!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1413354,"PostDate":1299655687,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> SUCH a great job!\u00a0 And thanks for the details on materials especially!\u00a0 I have been trying to figure out what thickness of paper to use and you wouldn't believe how hard it is to find that info!\u00a0 They look so awesome!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kclists@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1297455620,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236684.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KCB2011","Id":236684,"Name":"KCB2011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":176,"TotalPages":18,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":170},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
