{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19f39367ca6ecf4e3ea29e94804f5dbc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are amazing!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m really impressed that you used Word and still managed to make these look great.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble smarterwiki-popup-bubble-active\" style=\"top: 5px; left: 617px; margin-left: -51px; margin-top: -57px; opacity: 0.25;\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-body\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-links-container\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-links smarterwiki-clearfix\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-links-row smarterwiki-clearfix\"&gt;&lt;a class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link\" href=\"http:\/\/search.surfcanyon.com\/search?f=nrl1&amp;amp;q=These%20are%20amazing%21%20%20I%27m%20really%20impressed%20that%20you%20used%20Word%20and%20still%20managed%20to%20make%20these%20look%20great.&amp;amp;partner=fastestfox\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Search Surf Canyon\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link-favicon\" src=\"http:\/\/surfcanyon.com\/favicon.ico\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;a class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link\" href=\"http:\/\/www.google.com\/search?q=These%20are%20amazing%21%20%20I%27m%20really%20impressed%20that%20you%20used%20Word%20and%20still%20managed%20to%20make%20these%20look%20great.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Search Google\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link-favicon\" src=\"http:\/\/www.google.com\/favicon.ico\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-links-row smarterwiki-clearfix\"&gt;&lt;a class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link\" href=\"http:\/\/api3.smarterfox.com\/wikisearch\/search?q=These%20are%20amazing%21%20%20I%27m%20really%20impressed%20that%20you%20used%20Word%20and%20still%20managed%20to%20make%20these%20look%20great.&amp;amp;locale=en-US\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Search Wikipedia\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link-favicon\" src=\"http:\/\/static.smarterfox.com\/media\/wiki-favicon-sharpened.png\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;a class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link\" href=\"http:\/\/duckduckgo.com\/?q=These%20are%20amazing%21%20%20I%27m%20really%20impressed%20that%20you%20used%20Word%20and%20still%20managed%20to%20make%20these%20look%20great.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Search DuckDuckGo\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link-favicon\" src=\"http:\/\/ff.duckduckgo.com\/favicon.ico\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1413693,"PostDate":1299695498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are amazing!\u00a0 I'm really impressed that you used Word and still managed to make these look great.<\/p> <p> <span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble smarterwiki-popup-bubble-active\"  style=\"margin-left: -51px\"><span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-body\"><span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-links-container\"><span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-links smarterwiki-clearfix\"><span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-links-row smarterwiki-clearfix\"><a href='http:\/\/search.surfcanyon.com\/search?f=nrl1&q=These%20are%20amazing%21%20%20I%27m%20really%20impressed%20that%20you%20used%20Word%20and%20still%20managed%20to%20make%20these%20look%20great.&partner=fastestfox' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link-favicon\" src=\"http:\/\/surfcanyon.com\/favicon.ico\" \/><\/span><\/a><a href='http:\/\/www.google.com\/search?q=These%20are%20amazing%21%20%20I%27m%20really%20impressed%20that%20you%20used%20Word%20and%20still%20managed%20to%20make%20these%20look%20great.' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link-favicon\" src=\"http:\/\/www.google.com\/favicon.ico\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-links-row smarterwiki-clearfix\"><a href='http:\/\/api3.smarterfox.com\/wikisearch\/search?q=These%20are%20amazing%21%20%20I%27m%20really%20impressed%20that%20you%20used%20Word%20and%20still%20managed%20to%20make%20these%20look%20great.&locale=en-US' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link-favicon\" src=\"http:\/\/static.smarterfox.com\/media\/wiki-favicon-sharpened.png\" \/><\/span><\/a><a href='http:\/\/duckduckgo.com\/?q=These%20are%20amazing%21%20%20I%27m%20really%20impressed%20that%20you%20used%20Word%20and%20still%20managed%20to%20make%20these%20look%20great.' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"smarterwiki-popup-bubble-link-favicon\" src=\"http:\/\/ff.duckduckgo.com\/favicon.ico\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"zerogravitygrl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1288806113,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233684.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":240,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sugarfox","Id":233684,"Name":"sugarfox","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0ab369c442a861bf3a7b0123ecb785a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are beautiful...you should be so happy with the end results. &amp;nbsp;The wording, how it is put together, everything is perfect and a lot better than some of the professional ones I have seen.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; A couple of questions if you do not mind.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How many did you end up making? &amp;nbsp;Do you think it would print out the same on a home laser printing if you do not have a \"good commercial quality office laser printer\" to use?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How much did they cost to mail?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And how much do you think you spent total on making them?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks in advance&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1414250,"PostDate":1299765263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are beautiful...you should be so happy with the end results. \u00a0The wording, how it is put together, everything is perfect and a lot better than some of the professional ones I have seen.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> A couple of questions if you do not mind.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How many did you end up making? \u00a0Do you think it would print out the same on a home laser printing if you do not have a \"good commercial quality office laser printer\" to use?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How much did they cost to mail?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And how much do you think you spent total on making them?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks in advance<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"akamikey11@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1275741525,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228888.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":230,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akamikey11","Id":228888,"Name":"akamikey11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1db3202bc5188952da963235ebac6468","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks so much for the compliments!&amp;nbsp; And thanks for the nomination for the February contest!&amp;nbsp; Oddly I haven&#039;t heard much from our guests - I got so many e-mails\/texts\/calls on the boarding pass STD&#039;s but only about 2 for these which I think are far superior.&amp;nbsp; Oh well.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; akamikey11 - I made about 50 invites which didn&#039;t seem too daunting.&amp;nbsp; It cost me about $200 total but half of that was \"press\" printing the covers.&amp;nbsp; You can totally do it for less if you don&#039;t have the special printing.&amp;nbsp; I figured the rest of my printing was free so I could justify it.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m sure you&#039;d be fine with a home laser printer.&amp;nbsp; You might want to stick with a more white color but I think its fine.&amp;nbsp; The weight is thick enough for the invite (especially since I basically doubled up the covers by gluing them)&amp;nbsp;but not like cardstock which I think is harder to feed through printers.&amp;nbsp; And I think envelopes would be easier on a smaller home machine and might not need \"tricking\" like mine did.&amp;nbsp; I used a $.61 stamp to mail them which is standard for wedding invites.&amp;nbsp; If I hadn&#039;t have made the folders it would have been a regular $.44 stamp but that extra paper pushed it slightly over an ounce.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1414282,"PostDate":1299767505,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks so much for the compliments!\u00a0 And thanks for the nomination for the February contest!\u00a0 Oddly I haven't heard much from our guests - I got so many e-mails\/texts\/calls on the boarding pass STD's but only about 2 for these which I think are far superior.\u00a0 Oh well.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> akamikey11 - I made about 50 invites which didn't seem too daunting.\u00a0 It cost me about $200 total but half of that was \"press\" printing the covers.\u00a0 You can totally do it for less if you don't have the special printing.\u00a0 I figured the rest of my printing was free so I could justify it.\u00a0 I'm sure you'd be fine with a home laser printer.\u00a0 You might want to stick with a more white color but I think its fine.\u00a0 The weight is thick enough for the invite (especially since I basically doubled up the covers by gluing them)\u00a0but not like cardstock which I think is harder to feed through printers.\u00a0 And I think envelopes would be easier on a smaller home machine and might not need \"tricking\" like mine did.\u00a0 I used a $.61 stamp to mail them which is standard for wedding invites.\u00a0 If I hadn't have made the folders it would have been a regular $.44 stamp but that extra paper pushed it slightly over an ounce.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Steph & John........Atlantis.......June 18, 2011......happily married<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"steph@tmgatl.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283285042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231931.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skp1","Id":231931,"Name":"skp1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfe96032bb8aaa9e9b2e9599ff1ec42f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; THESE ARE AWESOME!!!! I would love to get this done for my wedding but I know I don&#039;t have the time. In your travels have you seen anyone do something on the level that you have? I&#039;m dying to get these!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1415587,"PostDate":1299944158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> THESE ARE AWESOME!!!! I would love to get this done for my wedding but I know I don't have the time. In your travels have you seen anyone do something on the level that you have? I'm dying to get these!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courud7346@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299561405,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/3\/3f\/3ffc90d6_user-37049-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dimplesandsuga","Id":237552,"Name":"dimplesandsuga","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ca0b6818c4b1dc2f3a2983d5ad502f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Steph those are fantastic you are very talented, i do not have an artistic bone in my body! I lived in Nassau for 2 years I lived at harborside resort which is part of Atlantis. You and your guests will have such a fun time. I left 2 years ago now and still really missed it. If you would like any suggestions on restaurants outside the resort let me know. Victoria","Attachments":[],"Id":1415709,"PostDate":1299965669,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Steph those are fantastic you are very talented, i do not have an artistic bone in my body! I lived in Nassau for 2 years I lived at harborside resort which is part of Atlantis. You and your guests will have such a fun time. I left 2 years ago now and still really missed it. If you would like any suggestions on restaurants outside the resort let me know. Victoria\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoriahodge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1256269951,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222792.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kiwibride","Id":222792,"Name":"kiwibride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"255535133fcfee400bf1ab14aea7d461","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Very nice, would you like to do mine for me??? &lt;span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1415739,"PostDate":1299971037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Very nice, would you like to do mine for me??? <span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>11.12.11...On this day I will marry my best friend, the one I laugh with and live for....<\/em><br><em>The Couples Resort - Tower Isle<\/em><br><em>Ocho Rios, Jamaica<\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sonya_anderson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1298257599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237015.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snanderson","Id":237015,"Name":"snanderson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3d030cc49b0eb6db34349d83d76be22","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These look amazing for DIY invites.&amp;nbsp; Thanks for posting.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1415900,"PostDate":1300029441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These look amazing for DIY invites.\u00a0 Thanks for posting.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malmgreg@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1297437625,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236667.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mpweddingplan","Id":236667,"Name":"mpweddingplan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a73d4a5eb9012b2f59bb7fdf0e2e8ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yes, DIY projects like do take a lot of time.&amp;nbsp; it&#039;s rewarding in the end though.&amp;nbsp; I tired to spread everything out over a month so as not to get overwhelmed - do one thing each night while watching TV.&amp;nbsp; I definitely have not mastered the art of efficiency - I bet if I tried selling them and added up the hours I spent,&amp;nbsp;I&#039;d end up making about China&#039;s minimum wage :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Funny thing is I&#039;m am a CPA - the most boring, uncreative (well except for those Andersen folks working on Enron) profession there is.&amp;nbsp; I guess that&#039;s why I go overboard in my personal projects - I need an outlet to express myself.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Kiwibride-I may need some recommendations for Nassau items - I&#039;m looking to have a low key (ie not Senor Frogs) bachelorette party 2 nights before the wedding. Any ideas?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1415944,"PostDate":1300034724,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes, DIY projects like do take a lot of time.\u00a0 it's rewarding in the end though.\u00a0 I tired to spread everything out over a month so as not to get overwhelmed - do one thing each night while watching TV.\u00a0 I definitely have not mastered the art of efficiency - I bet if I tried selling them and added up the hours I spent,\u00a0I'd end up making about China's minimum wage <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Funny thing is I'm am a CPA - the most boring, uncreative (well except for those Andersen folks working on Enron) profession there is.\u00a0 I guess that's why I go overboard in my personal projects - I need an outlet to express myself.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Kiwibride-I may need some recommendations for Nassau items - I'm looking to have a low key (ie not Senor Frogs) bachelorette party 2 nights before the wedding. Any ideas?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Steph & John........Atlantis.......June 18, 2011......happily married<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"steph@tmgatl.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283285042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231931.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skp1","Id":231931,"Name":"skp1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f52330752a9a8bee9f76d6027e96c3a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; wow these are amazing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1417845,"PostDate":1300293934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> wow these are amazing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>November 26th 2011 - Gran Bahai Principe Jamacia<\/span><br><span>Booked: 31 Adults + 5 children + Bride and Groom!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"melissa_prior@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299809207,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237667.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missmeliss","Id":237667,"Name":"missmeliss","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDat